  "bounded_claim": "This deterministic test examines only whether the frozen ExecutionFirewallV06 / ToolBrokerV06 path natively binds consequential standing to a distinct upstream agent or presenter identity when the underlying human authority and all existing execution-bound material remain otherwise valid. The positive and relay cases use fresh permits so durable permit-consumption replay controls do not confound the agent-presenter question. Harness-level Agent A / Agent B labels are observations external to the tested runtime and do not themselves establish a production identity system. This test does not establish swarm security, production exploitability, concurrency safety, external authentication, network identity, credential isolation, distributed-agent security, or protection against compromise of authorized humans, agents, resolvers, signing keys, deployment perimeters, or tool credentials.",
